From 7d578d0ccc2290387cb5babfbbd0cd34d1c383c4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 18:30:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] kanban: a worker's re-park of a hub card relays a
 board-reading wake_check to the hub

park_fields stamped probe_host = the parking gateway, so a worker node re-parking a copy of a hub card with a
probe that reads ~/.hermes/kanban.db read its OWN board and exited 1 forever (t_01a1cd7f37cfb8a7 on worker-2).
kanban_wake_check_hub_relay.relay_host names the hub as probe_host for such a park (block/timed park, schedule,
continue); the worker registers no probe and skips the dry run, the hub restores it from the synced park event.
Unchanged: own cards, non-hub homes, probes already routed via ssh/hub-admin, probes reading a worker-local
workspace or wake-checks script.
---
